# Event script standards

The Scripts/Events folder contains all the event scripts (i.e. WorkflowTaskUpdateAfter, ApplicationSubmitAfter, ApplicationSubmitBefore, etc). 
- Should not contain any other type of scripts. 
- All script names must be UPPER CASE. 
- The event scripts should only contain the include to the EH_% solution script only and should not contain any other code. 
- If new code is needed, it should be incased in a new EH_% script and included from the event script. 
- This will make it easier for projects to merge EH solutions into their existing scripting environment.

Example event script: 

```
// WTUA:ENVHEALTH/*/*/*
include("EH_WorkflowUpdateDailyTimeActivity");

include("EH_TIMESHEET_ADDUPDATEENTRIES");
```